# kwiddle

The Tkinter application for browsing and reading books.

Document parsing belongs to `kwloader`; this package contains the UI,
library scanning, navigation, and automatic update logic.

For local development with the sibling `kwloader` package:

```bash
python -m pip install -e ../kwloader
python -m pip install -e .
```
